#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:2
msgid "How to link to other documentation projects with Intersphinx"
msgstr "如何使用 Intersphinx 链接到其他文档项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:4
msgid ""
"This section shows you how to maintain references to named sections of other"
" external Sphinx projects."
msgstr "本节讲解如何维护对其他外部 Sphinx 项目中具名章节的引用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:6
msgid ""
"You may be familiar with using the :ref:`:ref: role <sphinx:ref-role>` to "
":doc:`link to any location of your docs </guides/cross-referencing-with-"
"sphinx>`. It helps you to keep all links within your docs up to date and "
"warns you if a reference target moves or changes so you can ensure that your"
" docs don't have broken cross-references."
msgstr ""
"你可能熟悉使用 :ref:`:ref: role <sphinx:ref-role>` 来 :doc:`链接到文档的任意位置 </guides"
"/cross-referencing-with-sphinx>` "
"。它帮助你保持文档内所有链接最新，并在引用目标移动或变更时发出警告，确保文档没有失效的交叉引用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:11
msgid ""
"Sometimes you may need to link to a specific section of another project's "
"documentation. While you could just hyperlink directly, there is a better "
"way. :doc:`Intersphinx <sphinx:usage/extensions/intersphinx>` allows you to "
"use all :ref:`cross-reference roles <sphinx:xref-syntax>` from Sphinx with "
"objects in other projects. That is, you could use the ``:ref:`` role to link"
" to sections of other documentation projects. Sphinx will ensure that your "
"cross-references to the other project exist and will raise a warning if they"
" are deleted or changed so you can keep your docs up to date."
msgstr ""
"有时你需要链接到另一个项目文档的特定章节。虽然可以直接加超链接，但有更好的方式。:doc:`Intersphinx "
"<sphinx:usage/extensions/intersphinx>` 让你能用 Sphinx 的所有 :ref:`交叉引用角色 <sphinx"
":xref-syntax>` 引用其他项目中的对象。也就是说，你可以用 ``:ref:`` 角色链接到其他文档项目的章节。Sphinx "
"会确保你对其他项目的交叉引用确实存在，并在其被删除或变更时发出警告，让你的文档保持最新。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:17
msgid ""
"If you are publishing several Sphinx projects together using Read the Docs' "
"*subprojects* (see :doc:`/subprojects`), you should use Intersphinx to "
"reference your subprojects from other projects."
msgstr ""
"若你使用 Read the Docs 的*子项目* （见 :doc:`/subprojects` ）一起发布多个 Sphinx 项目，应使用 "
"Intersphinx 从其他项目引用你的子项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:22
msgid ""
"You can also use Sphinx's ``linkcheck`` builder to check for broken links. "
"By default it will also check the validity of ``#anchors`` in links."
msgstr "你还可以使用 Sphinx 的 ``linkcheck`` 构建器检查失效链接。默认情况下它还会检查链接中 ``#anchors`` 的有效性。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:29
msgid ""
"See all the `options for the linkcheck builder <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/configuration.html#options-for-the-linkcheck-"
"builder>`__."
msgstr ""
"见 `linkcheck 构建器的所有选项 <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/configuration.html#options-for-the-linkcheck-"
"builder>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:32
msgid "Using Intersphinx"
msgstr "使用 Intersphinx"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:34
msgid ""
"To use Intersphinx you need to add it to the list of extensions in your "
"``conf.py`` file."
msgstr "要使用 Intersphinx，需将其加入 ``conf.py`` 文件的扩展列表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:44
msgid ""
"And use the ``intersphinx_mapping`` configuration to indicate the name and "
"link of the projects you want to use."
msgstr "并使用 ``intersphinx_mapping`` 配置指明你想使用的项目名称和链接。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:64
msgid ""
"If you are using Read the Docs' subprojects, you also need to enable the "
"Intersphinx extension on each of the subprojects. For each subproject, you "
"need to add the main project and all the other subprojects to "
"``intersphinx_mapping``."
msgstr ""
"若你使用 Read the Docs 的子项目，还需在每个子项目上启用 Intersphinx 扩展。对每个子项目，都需将主项目和其他所有子项目加入 "
"``intersphinx_mapping`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:67
msgid "Now you can use the ``sphinx`` name with a cross-reference role:"
msgstr "现在你可以在交叉引用角色中使用 ``sphinx`` 名称："

