#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:110
msgid ""
"You can use Intersphinx to link to subprojects, translations, another "
"version or any other project hosted in Read the Docs. For example:"
msgstr "你可以用 Intersphinx 链接到子项目、翻译、其他版本或 Read the Docs 托管的任何其他项目。例如："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:127
msgid "Intersphinx with private projects"
msgstr "与私有项目配合使用 Intersphinx"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:129
msgid ""
"If you are using :doc:`/commercial/index`, Intersphinx will not be able to "
"fetch the inventory file from private docs."
msgstr "若使用 :doc:`/commercial/index` ，Intersphinx 将无法从私有文档获取清单文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:132
msgid ""
"Intersphinx supports `URLs with Basic Authorization <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/extensions/intersphinx.html#using-intersphinx-with-"
"inventory-file-under-basic-authorization>`__, which Read the Docs supports "
":ref:`using a token <commercial/sharing:Basic Authorization>`. You need to "
"generate a token for each project you want to use with Intersphinx."
msgstr ""
"Intersphinx 支持 `带 Basic 认证的 URL <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/extensions/intersphinx.html#using-intersphinx-with-"
"inventory-file-under-basic-authorization>`__ ，Read the Docs 支持 :ref:`使用令牌 "
"<commercial/sharing:Basic Authorization>` 的方式。你需要为每个想与 Intersphinx "
"配合使用的项目生成令牌。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:136
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Sharing` of the project you want to use "
"with Intersphinx."
msgstr "前往想与 Intersphinx 配合使用的项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Sharing` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:137
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add share`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add share` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:138
msgid "Select :guilabel:`HTTP header token` as the :guilabel:`Access type`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`Access type` 中选择 :guilabel:`HTTP header token` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:139
msgid ""
"Set an :guilabel:`Expires` date long enough to use the token when building "
"your project."
msgstr "将 :guilabel:`Expires` 日期设置得足够长，以便构建项目时能使用该令牌。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:140
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Save` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:142
msgid "Now we can add the link to the private project with the token like:"
msgstr "现在可像这样添加带令牌的私有项目链接："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:169
msgid "Sphinx will strip the token from the URLs when generating the links."
msgstr "Sphinx 生成链接时会从 URL 中去除令牌。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:171
msgid ""
"You can use your tokens with environment variables, so you don't have to "
"hard code them in your ``conf.py`` file. See :doc:`/environment-variables` "
"to use environment variables inside Read the Docs."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过环境变量使用令牌，无需在 ``conf.py`` 文件中硬编码。在 Read the Docs 内使用环境变量请见 :doc"
":`/environment-variables` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:175
msgid ""
"For example, if you create an environment variable named ``RTD_TOKEN_DOCS`` "
"with the token from the \"docs\" project. You can use it like this:"
msgstr "例如，若你创建了名为 ``RTD_TOKEN_DOCS`` 的环境变量并填入 \"docs\" 项目的令牌，可以这样使用："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/intersphinx.rst:197
msgid ""
"Another way of using Intersphinx with private projects is to download the "
"inventory file and keep it in sync when the project changes. The inventory "
"file is by default located at ``objects.inv``, for example ``https"
"://readthedocs-docs.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/objects.inv``."
msgstr ""
"与私有项目配合使用 Intersphinx 的另一种方式是下载清单文件，并在项目变更时保持同步。清单文件默认位于 ``objects.inv`` ，例如"
" ``https://readthedocs-docs.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/objects.inv`` 。"

